officialText:
The commissioner shall maintain records of the following:
1. Applications and supporting documents for development in areas of special flood hazard;
2. Permits issued in areas of special flood hazard;
3. Inspection reports;
4. Certifications required in this appendix; and
5. Certificate of occupancy where applicable.

